{
  "info": {
    "name": "Garment ERP - Sales Orders",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "15 Sales Orders operations plus existing reference-data lookup. Run folder 1 in order. Folders 2/3/4 need the documented states or a new disposable order. No public fulfilment ingestion route; use CLI fixtures then Refresh detail before Close. Numeric versions are stored from responses. Postman retains the original key/body across missing responses or 5xx; the next retry reuses both. Definitive responses clear the saved attempt."
  },
